The Observers are a pair of beings that watch the world from behind a wall on a floor that does not exist, reached through the slip that opens from a rector's house. They are eyestalk beings, upright and curt, and the Weft are careful never to call them beholders. Only two of them were there when the Weft came through, and they were not at full strength.

They are the counterpart to [[Divinity/The Narrative/index|the Narrative]]. There are three observation spots, and a third Observer once stood with them. That one is gone, and [[Divinity/Immix|Immix]] had taken its place; the Observers would not say how or why it came to hold the spot, and would say only that the matter was between them and Immix. The pair can be paid for what they know, and the Weft offered them all of their Nox blood for answers.
